      "content": "Anniversary update!\r\n\r\nFoxyLand game celebrates its anniversary!\r\nNew levels with new mechanics are waiting for you!\r\nAlso added new languages!\r\nNew gamepad support. Now it is even more convenient to choose levels in the menu!\r\nRemoved bugs and defects.\r\n\r\nThe team of Or Monkey Studio together with BUG-Studio wants to thank all the players who played our game and left positive feedback.\r\nWe love You!\r\n\r\n\r\nUpdate 1.6.0 :\r\n- New Gamepad Support!\r\n- Added new languages( German, French, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese)\r\n- Added 9 new levels!\r\n- Bug fix.",
